      "claim": "Newton's law of universal gravitation gives a force F = G·M_sun·M_earth / r² directed toward the Sun.",
      "evidence": "Newton's law of gravitation; G = 6.674×10⁻¹¹ N·m²/kg², M_sun ≈ 1.99×10³⁰ kg, M_earth ≈ 5.97×10²⁴ kg, r ≈ 1 AU ≈ 1.496×10¹¹ m.",
      "weight": 0.4,
      "depends_on": []
